  "job_B2.2.5_20251003_114502": {
    "text": "Leofan men, eallum cristenum mannum is mycel \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t hy heora fulluhtes gescead witan; and\n\u00deonne is \u00e6rost se fruma \u00fe\u00e6t man gedo \u00feurh gode wissunge \u00fe\u00e6t he his Drihten ongyte rihtlice & \u00fe\u00e6t he\nAnd leornige \u00fe\u00e6t he cunne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc cristen man huru cunnan sceal, pater noster & credan.\nMid \u00feam pater nostre man sceal to Gode gebiddan & mid \u00feam credan geswutelian rihtne geleafan.\nAnd sy\u00f0\u00f0an se man \u00fe\u00e6t can & rihtne geleafan h\u00e6f\u00f0 ariht understanden, \u00feonne bi\u00f0 he wyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t he\nSe gelyf\u00f0 anr\u00e6dlice & rihtlice on hine se \u00f0e hine rihtlice lufa\u00f0, & se hine lufa\u00f0 rihtlice \u00f0e his beboda &\nElles ne by\u00f0 seo lufu naht, & elles ne freme\u00f0 eac \u00fe\u00e6t fulluht na swy\u00f0e, butan man Godes beboda gyme\nLeofan men, on \u00f0\u00e6re cristnunge \u00f0e man de\u00f0 \u00e6r \u00f0am fulluht is mycel getacnung.\n\u00deonne se sacerd cristna\u00f0, \u00feonne or\u00f0a\u00fe he on \u00feone man, \u00feonne hit swa gebyra\u00f0, in modum crucis, &\nTwa \u00f0ing syndon \u00feurh Godes mihte swa myccle & swa m\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fre \u00e6nig man he m\u00e6g \u00f0\u00e6ron \u00e6nig\nNis se m\u00e6ssepreost on worulde swa synful ne swa fracod on his d\u00e6dan, gyf he \u00f0\u00e6ra \u00feenunga a\u00feere de\u00f0\nNe eft nis \u00e6nig swa m\u00e6re ne swa haliges lifes \u00fe\u00e6t a\u00f0or \u00f0\u00e6ra \u00feenunga gegodian o\u00f0\u00f0on gemycclian\nDo swa hwylc swa hit do, Godes sylfes miht by\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re d\u00e6de \u00feurh halig geryne.\nAc se earma synfulla man hearma\u00f0 \u00feeah him sylfum egeslice swy\u00f0e se \u00fee ge\u00feristl\u00e6c\u00f0 to m\u00e6ssianne\nHis dyrstignes witodlice dere\u00f0 him sylfum, ac \u00fe\u00e6t ne dere\u00f0 elles \u00feam na \u00fee swy\u00f0or \u00fee \u00fea \u00f0enunga\nFor\u00f0am ne m\u00e6g \u00e6nig man Godes mihta ne his m\u00e6r\u00f0a geminsian ne \u00e6nig \u00f0ing awyrdan.\n\u00de\u00e6t sealt \u00fe\u00e6t se sacerd \u00feam men on mu\u00f0 de\u00f0 \u00feonne he cristna\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t getacna\u00f0 godcundne wisdom, &\nAnd \u00f0onne se sacerd him \u00e6tforan sing\u00f0, Credo in Deum, \u00feonne tryme\u00f0 he his geleafan & mid \u00f0am\nAnd \u00f0onne se sacerd \u00e6thrin\u00f0 mid his spatle \u00fe\u00e6s mannes nose & earan, \u00feonne tacna\u00f0 he mid \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd \u00f0onne se sacerd smyre\u00f0 mid \u00feam halgan crisman breost & sculdru, \u00feonne befeh\u00f0 he \u00fe\u00e6ne man\nAnd \u00f0onne \u00feis gedon bi\u00f0 eal fullice wel swa to \u00f0\u00e6re cristnunge gebyre\u00f0, \u00feonne is \u00e6fter eallum \u00feisum\nAnd \u00f0urh \u00fea fonthalgunge \u00fe\u00e6r gewyr\u00f0 sona Godes \u00e6lmihtiges midwist.\nAnd \u00f0urh \u00f0a or\u00f0unge \u00fee se sacerd on \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ter or\u00f0a\u00f0 \u00feonne he font halga\u00f0 wyr\u00f0 deofol \u00feanon\nAnd \u00f0onne se sacerd gehalgodne tapor in \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ter de\u00f0, \u00feonne wyr\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ter mid \u00feam halgan gaste\nAnd, hr\u00e6dest to secganne, eal \u00fe\u00e6t se sacerd de\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00f0a halgan \u00feenunge gesawenlice, eal hit fulfreme\u00f0\n\u00dea \u00f0reo dyfinga on fontb\u00e6\u00f0e getacnia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we beo\u00f0 geedcennede \u00feonne to ecan life \u00f0urh \u00fea halgan\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t hwite hr\u00e6gel \u00f0e man mid \u00fe\u00e6ne mann befeh\u00f0 \u00feonne he gefullod bi\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t getacna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ne\nAnd mid \u00feam crismale \u00fee man him onufan \u00fe\u00e6t heafod de\u00f0 man tacna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ne cristenan cynehelm \u00fee he\nFor\u00f0am gyf he \u00fe\u00e6t gehealde\u00f0, he bi\u00f0 Criste to bearne geteald, & he bi\u00f0 cynehelmes swy\u00f0e wel wyr\u00f0e,\nHe is ure ealra f\u00e6der, & \u00fe\u00e6t we swutelia\u00f0 \u00feonne we singa\u00f0, Pater noster qui es in celis sanctificetur\nBe \u00f0ysum we magon gecnawan \u00fe\u00e6t we syn \u00feurh cristendom ealle gebro\u00f0ra \u00feonne we ealle to anum\n\u00deonne eac \u00e6fter \u00f0ysum he bi\u00f0 wel husles wyr\u00f0e, & him gebyre\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t swy\u00f0e rihte \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feonne \u00feicge\nLeofan men, understanda\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Crist is cristenra heafod, & ealle cristene men syndon to Cristes limum\n\u00d0onne is mycel \u00f0earf \u00fe\u00e6t cristenra manna gehwylc \u00fe\u00e6t understande & \u00fe\u00e6t he his cristendom mid\nSe gehealt his cristendom rihtlice se \u00f0e Criste mid rihte gehyr\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00f0 se \u00f0e his bebodu gehealde\u00f0,\nUnderstanda\u00f0 Godes beboda georne.\nGodes agen \u00fe\u00e6t forme bebod is \u00fe\u00e6t man lufige Godd sylfne \u00e6rest eallum mode & eallum m\u00e6gene, &\n\u00c6lc cristen man is o\u00f0res nyhsta, for\u00f0am we synd \u00feurh cristendom ealle gebro\u00f0ra, & we syndon\nAnd \u00f0y hit is rihtlic dom \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig cristen man o\u00f0rum ne beode butan \u00fe\u00e6t he wille \u00fe\u00e6t man him\nLeofan men, we motan swy\u00f0e w\u00e6rlice on \u00e6lce wisan us healdan gyf we us sculan wi\u00f0 deofol\nAc utan understandan hw\u00e6t \u00f0a twa word m\u00e6nan, abrenuntio & credo, \u00fee man \u00e6t fulluht\u00feenunge on\nAbrenuntio, \u00fe\u00e6t is on Englisc, ic wi\u00f0sace heononfor\u00f0 \u00e6fre deofles gemanan.\nCredo, \u00fe\u00e6t is on Englisc, ic gelyfe on God \u00e6lmihtigne \u00fee ealle \u00f0ing gescop & geworhte.\nNage we nane \u00f0earfe \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00f0yses weor\u00f0an lease; ac utan don swa us \u00feearf is, gel\u00e6stan hit georne.\nAnd \u00f0eah \u00fe\u00e6t cild to \u00f0am geong sy \u00fe\u00e6t hit specan ne m\u00e6ge, \u00feonne hit man fulla\u00f0, his freonda forsp\u00e6c\n& butan hit gel\u00e6ste, \u00f0onne hit ylde h\u00e6f\u00f0, eal \u00fe\u00e6t on his geogo\u00f0e for hit Gode w\u00e6s behaten, hit mot\n\u00deonne agan \u00fea yldran eac on cristenum folce \u00f0\u00e6s ofer\u00feearfe \u00fe\u00e6t hi heora gingran Gode gestrynan &\nFor\u00f0am eal \u00fe\u00e6t hi to unrihte ge\u00f0afia\u00f0 heora gingran, eal hit by\u00f0 ongean \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0e hy Gode behetan \u00fea hy\nCristenra manna gehwylc ah swy\u00f0e mycle \u00feearfe \u00fe\u00e6t he rihtne geleafan on \u00e6nne Godd \u00e6fre habbe, &\nAnd \u00e6fre swa \u00fe\u00e6t cild ra\u00f0ost \u00e6nig \u00f0ing specan m\u00e6ge, t\u00e6ce man him sona ealra \u00feinga \u00e6rest pater\nAnd eac ic on Godes naman bidde & beode, gyf \u00e6nig cristen man \u00fee ylde h\u00e6bbe swa sy forgymed \u00fe\u00e6t\nAc do manna gehwylc swa swa him \u00f0earf is, leornige his \u00feearfe & hine sylfne w\u00e6rlice be\u00f0ence & his\nLeofan men, beorga\u00f0 eow georne wi\u00f0 deofles lara.\nNe beon ge na\u00f0or ne to swicole ne to ficole, ne lease ne lu\u00f0erfulle ne fule ne fracode, ne on \u00e6nige\nNe ge ahwar ne beon, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e ge betan magan, gewitan ne gewyrhtan \u00e6niges mor\u00f0res o\u00f0\u00f0on\nScylda\u00f0 eow wi\u00f0 gitsunga & wi\u00f0 gifornessa, & \u00f0\u00e6t ge ahwar ne beon manswican ne mansworan,\nAnd scylda\u00f0 eow wi\u00f0 galscypas & swy\u00f0e georne wi\u00f0 \u00e6wbrecas, & wi\u00f0 oferfylle beorga\u00f0 eow georne.\nAnd ne gyman ge galdra ne idelra hwata, ne wigelunga ne wiccecr\u00e6fta; & ne weor\u00f0ian ge wyllas ne\nNe beon ge ofermode ne to weamode ne to ni\u00f0fulle ne to flitgeorne ne to felawyrde ne ealles to\nAnd ne beon ge to rance ne to gylpgeorne ne f\u00e6ringa to f\u00e6gene ne eft to ormode, & ne beon ge to\nEalle un\u00f0eawas awealla\u00f0 of deofle & he \u00fe\u00e6t uns\u00e6d sawe\u00f0 to wide.\nAc utan don swa us \u00f0earf is, helpan ure sylfra, & \u00f0\u00e6s huru efstan, nu we fyrst habba\u00f0 \u00fea hwile \u00f0e God\nAnd utan \u00f0urh \u00e6ghw\u00e6t Godes willan wyrcan swa we geornost magan; \u00feonne geleana\u00f0 he hit us \u00fe\u00e6r\nHim symle sy lof & wuldor in ealra worulda woruld a butan ende, amen.",
